.TH WERKMEISTER-DASHBOARD 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-dashboard \- Run the localhost workspaces dashboard in the foreground (checkout only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister dashboard\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Runs the localhost workspaces dashboard in the foreground. Only from a checkout: the \fBwerkmeister\fR wrapper launches it, so running \fBdist/main.js\fR directly just prints that.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
